Here's your set as a practice sheet. Answer each question in your own words, including the "why" where a question asks for it. Open a hint only if you're stuck. The hints work through similar cases, not your exact ones. When you're done, send everything and I'll give you a verdict on each answer, then we'll work on whatever didn't hold up.

```show_widget
<div id="app" style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:4px;color:inherit">
<style>
.c{border:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.4);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.q{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.4}
textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-height:56px;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.5);background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;font-size:14px;resize:vertical}
